name: example
description: |
  Rename this file to example.yaml (or something more descriptive) and edit
  the prompts to match your team's real work.
category: general
prompts:
  - id: summarize-changelog
    prompt: |
      Summarize this changelog entry for a non-technical stakeholder in 2 sentences:

      "Migrated the primary write path from SQLite to Postgres to unblock
      horizontal scaling. Read replicas now serve ~85% of read traffic;
      p99 read latency dropped 40ms."
  - id: bug-triage
    prompt: |
      A user reports: "the export button downloads an empty CSV about 1 in 10
      times." Write a 3-step debugging plan.
  - id: explain-concept
    prompt: |
      Explain what "backpressure" means in a streaming system, in one paragraph,
      to someone who understands HTTP but not distributed systems.
